# Experiment raw artifacts.
# These are DATA and are tracked by design (the directive requires result
# provenance). Large or regenerable blobs do not belong here -- commit the
# manifest/hashes instead of multi-megabyte outputs.
# experiments/results/*.json

# Never commit credentials. The directive (sec. 10) requires secure handling.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
credentials.json
secrets.json

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini